OL,3,GNEWSA'Not only did I survive, I
OL,4,Athrived' - Meera Syal
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Meera Syal has said she "almost
OL,7,Fgave up" her career after being
OL,8,Fsexually harassed and assaulted by two
OL,9,F"predators" within the media industry.
OL,11,F"I was out of work, I was homeless,
OL,12,Fsleeping on people's floors, and then
OL,13,Fthese two things happened in quite
OL,14,Fquick succession," the
OL,15,FWolverhampton-born star said in a
OL,16,Fcandid interview with BBC Asian
OL,17,FNetwork's Amber Haque.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
